 "notes": "Volume (pp. 1-22) holds the 1949 ordinary congressional election front matter: decree/text pages, party registration acts (pp. 4-14, including the Acta de Inscripción de Partidos for 1949-1953 listing each party's senators by circunscripción provincial and deputies by agrupación), the Senate section (p15) and the senate synoptic table by commune/department/province 'de acuerdo con los escrutinios efectuados por el Tribunal Calificador' for circunscripciones 2, 4, 6 and 8 (pp. 16-21). Each list is a party column with candidates presented/elected; the extra key 'presented' records the P. (candidatos presentados) count. Candidate-level votes are not printed; elected senators' names come from the Acta (pp. 12-13). p22 is a grey, low-contrast fold-out summary table (appears to include a DIPUTADOS block) that was not transcribed. National row 'TOTAL GENERAL' (p21): party totals as printed except Radical Democrático, printed '445' with digits missing (P. 3, E. 1); 10445 is reconstructed from the circunscripción totals (1 031 + 3 612 + 5 802) and makes the national party sum equal the printed 250 552. Registered voters are not printed anywhere."
